        "content": "<p>Are <code>expect</code> statements in type definitions supposed to run with <code>roc test</code>?</p>\n<p>For example, this expect is not being run with <code>roc test</code>:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Rust\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">Ascii</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">List</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Char</span><span class=\"p\">).{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">from_chars</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">List</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Char</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">Ascii</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">from_chars</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"n\">chars</span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Ascii</span><span class=\"p\">.(</span><span class=\"n\">chars</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">to_chars</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">Ascii</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">List</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Char</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">to_chars</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"n\">Ascii</span><span class=\"p\">.(</span><span class=\"n\">chars</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">chars</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">##</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Round</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">trip</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">test</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">expect</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">hello_chars</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"n\">Char</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">from_ascii_byte</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"sc\">'h'</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">??</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">                </span><span class=\"n\">crash</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"Unreachable\"</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"p\">},</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"n\">Char</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">from_ascii_byte</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"sc\">'e'</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">??</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">                </span><span class=\"n\">crash</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"Unreachable\"</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"p\">},</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"n\">Char</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">from_ascii_byte</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"sc\">'l'</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">??</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">                </span><span class=\"n\">crash</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"Unreachable\"</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"p\">},</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"n\">Char</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">from_ascii_byte</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"sc\">'l'</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">??</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">                </span><span class=\"n\">crash</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"Unreachable\"</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"p\">},</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"n\">Char</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">from_ascii_byte</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"sc\">'o'</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">??</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">                </span><span class=\"n\">crash</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"Unreachable\"</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"p\">},</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">out</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Ascii</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">from_chars</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">hello_chars</span><span class=\"p\">).</span><span class=\"n\">to_chars</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">out</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hello_chars</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Cheers :)</p>",
